# Justified exceptions for scripts/check-storage-keys.mjs, one per line:
#   <path> | <text on the flagged line> | <reason>
# Keep this short. Prefer the shared key modules.
apps/portal-api/src/ingest/ingest-upload-handle.ts | INGEST_UPLOAD_PREFIX = 'ingest-upload/' | Prefix of older resumable uploads (`ingest-upload/<userId>/`). Used by the sweep and the free-space count, which run as system work, and to check that a signed upload handle in the older layout names the caller's own prefix; it builds no key.
